// Frame D: five members, week 4, Thursday. Max and Leo stream together and
// share the wide hero, one LIVE tag and a play ring each, no filled white
// button. The Monday recap holds the side column, tall. Head2head is two
// columns wide with the pair rows in two columns and no seats and no button.
// The live game is the cell beside it. The poster grid leads the next row, and
// the invite card beside it carries the one red button. The data path for a
// second live stream is a later phase (CLIPS 7.2): the strips draw from mock
// data. Row order differs from the mockup: the grid has no three-cell clip row.
